        "original_id": "5c30bc1a-b6d3-51c3-b14f-9bda51e19201",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Lee, Kevin Smith, Scott Mosier, David Schwimmer, Mili Avital, Kari Wührer, Vanessa Angel\n- Films: Mallrats, Chasing Amy, Dogma, Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back, Jersey Girl, Clerks II, Cop Out, Kissing a Fool\n- Organizations: View Askew Productions\n- Concepts: View Askewniverse\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Lee is known for roles in Kevin Smith films including Mallrats, Chasing Amy, Dogma, Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back, Jersey Girl, Clerks II, and Cop Out.\n- Kevin Smith's films often feature crossover plot elements, character references, and a shared canon known by fans as the View Askewniverse.\n- The View Askewniverse is named after View Askew Productions, which Kevin Smith co-founded with Scott Mosier.\n- Kissing a Fool primarily stars David Schwimmer, Jason Lee, Mili Avital, Kari Wührer, and Vanessa Angel.",
